<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue id="8d3a-77b7-da77-d3e0" name="Early Polish" revision="8" battleScribeVersion="2.03" authorName="Jono Firth" authorUrl="https://www.greatescapegames.co.uk/uploads/images/wysiwyg/home-shortcuts/coe/darkages/Early_Polish_January_13th_2012.pdf" library="false" gameSystemId="c749-87c2-0d4a-5e29" gameSystemRevision="12" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema">
  <readme>This army list covers the Poles from the reign of Mieszko I until the anti-christian uprisings in the 10th century and the collapse of the Early Polish princedom. Historical enemies include the Eastern Franks, Vikings, Western Slavs, Bohemians and Rus.

An Early Polish army must include a general, at least one unit of Druzhina cavalry, one unit of spearmen und one unit of archers.</readme>
